{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788187506069,"sessionID":"ses_fa7b8803dffeRqKSqOdXqoOMCz","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_DjMBPkwICckx1gGqgbTJuObs","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/pii_policy.md"},"output":"<path>/workspace/in/schema_migration/pii_policy.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # PII Policy\n2: \n3: Do not copy obvious sensitive payment or identity fields into `metadata.unknownFields`.\n4: \n5: Excluded keys include:\n6: - `ssn`\n7: - `credit_card`\n8: - `card_number`\n9: - `cvv`\n10: - `phone_number`\n11: - `passport_number`\n12: \n13: Non-sensitive campaign, channel, loyalty, gift, or routing metadata may be preserved.\n\n(End of file - total 13 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# PII Policy\n\nDo not copy obvious sensitive payment or identity fields into `metadata.unknownFields`.\n\nExcluded keys include:\n- `ssn`\n- `credit_card`\n- `card_number`\n- `cvv`\n- `phone_number`\n- `passport_number`\n\nNon-sensitive campaign, channel, loyalty, gift, or routing metadata may be preserved.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/pii_policy.md","text":"# PII Policy\n\nDo not copy obvious sensitive payment or identity fields into `metadata.unknownFields`.\n\nExcluded keys include:\n- `ssn`\n- `credit_card`\n- `card_number`\n- `cvv`\n- `phone_number`\n- `passport_number`\n\nNon-sensitive campaign, channel, loyalty, gift, or routing metadata may be preserved.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":13,"totalLines":13,"truncated":false}},"title":"workspace/in/schema_migration/pii_policy.md","time":{"start":1788187506040,"end":1788187506064}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_08e527235fe39e7c016a959371ece887d28afa8d398b4f8403"}},"id":"prt_05847f575001pKoXHAnrzZkFOf","sessionID":"ses_fa7b8803dffeRqKSqOdXqoOMCz","messageID":"msg_05847e675001KYJEdXm0iIP7fq"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788187506069,"sessionID":"ses_fa7b8803dffeRqKSqOdXqoOMCz","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_C2YYjDdHzeE45Uvbtmz3owJS","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/client.py"},"output":"<path>/workspace/in/schema_migration/client.py</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: def convert_order(payload):\n2:     \"\"\"Convert a legacy v1 order payload to the v2 public API shape.\"\"\"\n3:     return {\n4:         \"orderId\": payload[\"id\"],\n5:         \"customer\": payload[\"customer_name\"],\n6:         \"items\": payload[\"items\"],\n7:         \"address\": payload[\"ship_to\"],\n8:     }\n9: \n10: \n11: def summarize_order(v2_payload):\n12:     return f\"{v2_payload['orderId']}:{len(v2_payload['lineItems'])}\"\n\n(End of file - total 12 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"def convert_order(payload):\n    \"\"\"Convert a legacy v1 order payload to the v2 public API shape.\"\"\"\n    return {\n        \"orderId\": payload[\"id\"],\n        \"customer\": payload[\"customer_name\"],\n        \"items\": payload[\"items\"],\n        \"address\": payload[\"ship_to\"],\n    }\n\n\ndef summarize_order(v2_payload):\n    return f\"{v2_payload['orderId']}:{len(v2_payload['lineItems'])}\"","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/client.py","text":"def convert_order(payload):\n    \"\"\"Convert a legacy v1 order payload to the v2 public API shape.\"\"\"\n    return {\n        \"orderId\": payload[\"id\"],\n        \"customer\": payload[\"customer_name\"],\n        \"items\": payload[\"items\"],\n        \"address\": payload[\"ship_to\"],\n    }\n\n\ndef summarize_order(v2_payload):\n    return f\"{v2_payload['orderId']}:{len(v2_payload['lineItems'])}\"","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":12,"totalLines":12,"truncated":false}},"title":"workspace/in/schema_migration/client.py","time":{"start":1788187506047,"end":1788187506066}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_08e527235fe39e7c016a959371ecf487d2ae46d9e57bfba532"}},"id":"prt_05847f57c001TkQznF13FyrDAv","sessionID":"ses_fa7b8803dffeRqKSqOdXqoOMCz","messageID":"msg_05847e675001KYJEdXm0iIP7fq"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788187506069,"sessionID":"ses_fa7b8803dffeRqKSqOdXqoOMCz","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_CHTsbJYZOppFceIvWiwk4ktT","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/migration_notes.md"},"output":"<path>/workspace/in/schema_migration/migration_notes.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Order API Migration Notes\n2: \n3: Supported inputs:\n4: - Legacy v1 payloads use `id`, `customer_id`, `customer_name`, `items`, `ship_to`, and optional `shipping_method`.\n5: - Legacy v1.1 payloads may use `shipping` instead of `shipping_method`, and `ship_to.postalCode` instead of `ship_to.postal`.\n6: - Legacy v1.2 payloads may use `order_ref`, `customer.id`, `customer.name`, `lines`, and `shipTo`. Line items may use `unit_price_cents` instead of `price_cents`.\n7: - Public v2 payloads already have `orderId`, `buyer`, `lineItems`, `shipping`, and `metadata`; conversion must be idempotent.\n8: \n9: Field mapping:\n10: - `id` -> `orderId`\n11: - `order_ref` -> `orderId`\n12: - `customer_id` -> `buyer.id`\n13: - `customer_name` -> `buyer.displayName`\n14: - `customer.id` -> `buyer.id`\n15: - `customer.name` -> `buyer.displayName`\n16: - `lines` -> `lineItems`\n17: - each item `qty` -> `quantity` as an integer\n18: - each item `price_cents` -> `unitPriceCents` as an integer\n19: - each item `unit_price_cents` -> `unitPriceCents` as an integer\n20: - `ship_to.postal` or `ship_to.postalCode` -> `shipping.address.postalCode`\n21: - `shipTo.postal_code` -> `shipping.address.postalCode`\n22: - blank or null shipping method -> `standard`\n23: \n24: Unknown legacy fields should be preserved in `metadata.unknownFields` unless the PII policy excludes them.\n25: \n26: Errors from `convert_many` should include `index`, `path`, and `error`, and conversion should continue after bad records.\n27: \n28: Warnings:\n29: - `convert_many` should return `(converted, errors, warnings)` when warnings are present, or preserve backward compatibility by allowing callers to unpack the first two values.\n30: - A warning should include `index`, `path`, and `warning`.\n31: - Dropped PII and preserved unknown fields should be counted in `conversion_audit.json`.\n32: - The module must support `python -m client input.jsonl output.json`, writing converted records to the output path and `conversion_audit.json` next to `client.py`.\n\n(End of file - total 32 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Order API Migration Notes\n\nSupported inputs:\n- Legacy v1 payloads use `id`, `customer_id`, `customer_name`, `items`, `ship_to`, and optional `shipping_method`.\n- Legacy v1.1 payloads may use `shipping` instead of `shipping_method`, and `ship_to.postalCode` instead of `ship_to.postal`.\n- Legacy v1.2 payloads may use `order_ref`, `customer.id`, `customer.name`, `lines`, and `shipTo`. Line items may use `unit_price_cents` instead of `price_cents`.\n- Public v2 payloads already have `orderId`, `buyer`, `lineItems`, `shipping`, and `metadata`; conversion must be idempotent.\n\nField mapping:\n- `id` -> `orderId`\n- `order_ref` -> `orderId`\n- `customer_id` -> `buyer.id`\n- `customer_name` -> `buyer.displayName`\n- `customer.id` -> `buyer.id`\n- `customer.name` -> `buyer.displayName`\n- `lines` -> `lineItems`\n- each item `qty` -> `quantity` as an integer\n- each item `price_cents` -> `unitPriceCents` as an integer\n- each item `unit_price_cents` -> `unitPriceCents` as an integer\n- `ship_to.postal` or `ship_to.postalCode` -> `shipping.address.postalCode`","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/migration_notes.md","text":"# Order API Migration Notes\n\nSupported inputs:\n- Legacy v1 payloads use `id`, `customer_id`, `customer_name`, `items`, `ship_to`, and optional `shipping_method`.\n- Legacy v1.1 payloads may use `shipping` instead of `shipping_method`, and `ship_to.postalCode` instead of `ship_to.postal`.\n- Legacy v1.2 payloads may use `order_ref`, `customer.id`, `customer.name`, `lines`, and `shipTo`. Line items may use `unit_price_cents` instead of `price_cents`.\n- Public v2 payloads already have `orderId`, `buyer`, `lineItems`, `shipping`, and `metadata`; conversion must be idempotent.\n\nField mapping:\n- `id` -> `orderId`\n- `order_ref` -> `orderId`\n- `customer_id` -> `buyer.id`\n- `customer_name` -> `buyer.displayName`\n- `customer.id` -> `buyer.id`\n- `customer.name` -> `buyer.displayName`\n- `lines` -> `lineItems`\n- each item `qty` -> `quantity` as an integer\n- each item `price_cents` -> `unitPriceCents` as an integer\n- each item `unit_price_cents` -> `unitPriceCents` as an integer\n- `ship_to.postal` or `ship_to.postalCode` -> `shipping.address.postalCode`\n- `shipTo.postal_code` -> `shipping.address.postalCode`\n- blank or null shipping method -> `standard`\n\nUnknown legacy fields should be preserved in `metadata.unknownFields` unless the PII policy excludes them.\n\nErrors from `convert_many` should include `index`, `path`, and `error`, and conversion should continue after bad records.\n\nWarnings:\n- `convert_many` should return `(converted, errors, warnings)` when warnings are present, or preserve backward compatibility by allowing callers to unpack the first two values.\n- A warning should include `index`, `path`, and `warning`.\n- Dropped PII and preserved unknown fields should be counted in `conversion_audit.json`.\n- The module must support `python -m client input.jsonl output.json`, writing converted records to the output path and `conversion_audit.json` next to `client.py`.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":32,"totalLines":32,"truncated":false}},"title":"workspace/in/schema_migration/migration_notes.md","time":{"start":1788187506036,"end":1788187506067}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_08e527235fe39e7c016a959371ecdc87d280c64b4b5b4df973"}},"id":"prt_05847f571001vPbCDiUqJJZtzG","sessionID":"ses_fa7b8803dffeRqKSqOdXqoOMCz","messageID":"msg_05847e675001KYJEdXm0iIP7fq"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788187506071,"sessionID":"ses_fa7b8803dffeRqKSqOdXqoOMCz","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_S57MncWOziQwAFkiP6ldw536","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/tests/test_client.py"},"output":"<path>/workspace/in/schema_migration/tests/test_client.py</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: from client import convert_order, summarize_order, convert_many\n2: \n3: \n4: LEGACY = {\n5:     \"id\": \"A100\",\n6:     \"customer_id\": \"C-7\",\n7:     \"customer_name\": \"Mina Park\",\n8:     \"items\": [{\"sku\": \"PEN\", \"qty\": 3, \"price_cents\": 129}],\n9:     \"ship_to\": {\"country\": \"US\", \"postal\": \"02139\"},\n10:     \"shipping_method\": \"standard\",\n11: }\n12: \n13: \n14: def test_convert_order_to_v2_shape():\n15:     assert convert_order(LEGACY) == {\n16:         \"orderId\": \"A100\",\n17:         \"buyer\": {\"id\": \"C-7\", \"displayName\": \"Mina Park\"},\n18:         \"lineItems\": [{\"sku\": \"PEN\", \"quantity\": 3, \"unitPriceCents\": 129}],\n19:         \"shipping\": {\"method\": \"standard\", \"address\": {\"country\": \"US\", \"postalCode\": \"02139\"}},\n20:         \"metadata\": {\"source\": \"legacy-v1\"},\n21:     }\n22: \n23: \n24: def test_defaults_shipping_method_and_keeps_summary_contract():\n25:     migrated = convert_order({**LEGACY, \"shipping_method\": \"\"})\n26:     assert migrated[\"shipping\"][\"method\"] == \"standard\"\n27:     assert summarize_order(migrated) == \"A100:1\"\n28: \n29: \n30: def test_new_payload_passthrough_and_nullable_defaults():\n31:     v2 = {\n32:         \"orderId\": \"B200\",\n33:         \"buyer\": {\"id\": \"C-8\", \"displayName\": \"Owen\"},\n34:         \"lineItems\": [{\"sku\": \"BOX\", \"quantity\": 1, \"unitPriceCents\": 500}],\n35:         \"shipping\": {\"method\": None, \"address\": {\"country\": \"US\", \"postalCode\": \"10001\"}},\n36:         \"metadata\": {\"source\": \"public-v2\", \"unknownFields\": {\"campaign\": \"spring\"}},\n37:     }\n38:     migrated = convert_order(v2)\n39:     assert migrated[\"orderId\"] == \"B200\"\n40:     assert migrated[\"shipping\"][\"method\"] == \"standard\"\n41:     assert migrated[\"metadata\"][\"unknownFields\"] == {\"campaign\": \"spring\"}\n42: \n43: \n44: def test_convert_many_collects_errors_without_stopping():\n45:     result = convert_many([LEGACY, {\"id\": \"bad\", \"items\": []}])\n46:     ok, errors = result[0], result[1]\n47:     assert len(ok) == 1\n48:     assert errors and errors[0][\"index\"] == 1\n49:     assert \"missing\" in errors[0][\"error\"].lower() or \"customer\" in errors[0][\"error\"].lower()\n50: \n51: \n52: def test_v12_payload_and_unknown_field_preservation():\n53:     payload = {\n54:         \"order_ref\": \"E500\",\n55:         \"customer\": {\"id\": \"C-11\", \"name\": \"Iris\"},\n56:         \"lines\": [{\"sku\": \"MUG\", \"qty\": \"4\", \"unit_price_cents\": \"325\"}],\n57:         \"shipTo\": {\"country\": \"US\", \"postal_code\": \"94105\"},\n58:         \"shipping_method\": \"\",\n59:         \"routing_tag\": \"beta\",\n60:         \"card_number\": \"4111\",\n61:     }\n62:     migrated = convert_order(payload)\n63:     assert migrated[\"orderId\"] == \"E500\"\n64:     assert migrated[\"buyer\"] == {\"id\": \"C-11\", \"displayName\": \"Iris\"}\n65:     assert migrated[\"lineItems\"] == [{\"sku\": \"MUG\", \"quantity\": 4, \"unitPriceCents\": 325}]\n66:     assert migrated[\"shipping\"][\"method\"] == \"standard\"\n67:     assert migrated[\"shipping\"][\"address\"][\"postalCode\"] == \"94105\"\n68:     assert migrated[\"metadata\"][\"unknownFields\"] == {\"routing_tag\": \"beta\"}\n\n(End of file - total 68 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"from client import convert_order, summarize_order, convert_many\n\n\nLEGACY = {\n    \"id\": \"A100\",\n    \"customer_id\": \"C-7\",\n    \"customer_name\": \"Mina Park\",\n    \"items\": [{\"sku\": \"PEN\", \"qty\": 3, \"price_cents\": 129}],\n    \"ship_to\": {\"country\": \"US\", \"postal\": \"02139\"},\n    \"shipping_method\": \"standard\",\n}\n\n\ndef test_convert_order_to_v2_shape():\n    assert convert_order(LEGACY) == {\n        \"orderId\": \"A100\",\n        \"buyer\": {\"id\": \"C-7\", \"displayName\": \"Mina Park\"},\n        \"lineItems\": [{\"sku\": \"PEN\", \"quantity\": 3, \"unitPriceCents\": 129}],\n        \"shipping\": {\"method\": \"standard\", \"address\": {\"country\": \"US\", \"postalCode\": \"02139\"}},\n        \"metadata\": {\"source\": \"legacy-v1\"},","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/tests/test_client.py","text":"from client import convert_order, summarize_order, convert_many\n\n\nLEGACY = {\n    \"id\": \"A100\",\n    \"customer_id\": \"C-7\",\n    \"customer_name\": \"Mina Park\",\n    \"items\": [{\"sku\": \"PEN\", \"qty\": 3, \"price_cents\": 129}],\n    \"ship_to\": {\"country\": \"US\", \"postal\": \"02139\"},\n    \"shipping_method\": \"standard\",\n}\n\n\ndef test_convert_order_to_v2_shape():\n    assert convert_order(LEGACY) == {\n        \"orderId\": \"A100\",\n        \"buyer\": {\"id\": \"C-7\", \"displayName\": \"Mina Park\"},\n        \"lineItems\": [{\"sku\": \"PEN\", \"quantity\": 3, \"unitPriceCents\": 129}],\n        \"shipping\": {\"method\": \"standard\", \"address\": {\"country\": \"US\", \"postalCode\": \"02139\"}},\n        \"metadata\": {\"source\": \"legacy-v1\"},\n    }\n\n\ndef test_defaults_shipping_method_and_keeps_summary_contract():\n    migrated = convert_order({**LEGACY, \"shipping_method\": \"\"})\n    assert migrated[\"shipping\"][\"method\"] == \"standard\"\n    assert summarize_order(migrated) == \"A100:1\"\n\n\ndef test_new_payload_passthrough_and_nullable_defaults():\n    v2 = {\n        \"orderId\": \"B200\",\n        \"buyer\": {\"id\": \"C-8\", \"displayName\": \"Owen\"},\n        \"lineItems\": [{\"sku\": \"BOX\", \"quantity\": 1, \"unitPriceCents\": 500}],\n        \"shipping\": {\"method\": None, \"address\": {\"country\": \"US\", \"postalCode\": \"10001\"}},\n        \"metadata\": {\"source\": \"public-v2\", \"unknownFields\": {\"campaign\": \"spring\"}},\n    }\n    migrated = convert_order(v2)\n    assert migrated[\"orderId\"] == \"B200\"\n    assert migrated[\"shipping\"][\"method\"] == \"standard\"\n    assert migrated[\"metadata\"][\"unknownFields\"] == {\"campaign\": \"spring\"}\n\n\ndef test_convert_many_collects_errors_without_stopping():\n    result = convert_many([LEGACY, {\"id\": \"bad\", \"items\": []}])\n    ok, errors = result[0], result[1]\n    assert len(ok) == 1\n    assert errors and errors[0][\"index\"] == 1\n    assert \"missing\" in errors[0][\"error\"].lower() or \"customer\" in errors[0][\"error\"].lower()\n\n\ndef test_v12_payload_and_unknown_field_preservation():\n    payload = {\n        \"order_ref\": \"E500\",\n        \"customer\": {\"id\": \"C-11\", \"name\": \"Iris\"},\n        \"lines\": [{\"sku\": \"MUG\", \"qty\": \"4\", \"unit_price_cents\": \"325\"}],\n        \"shipTo\": {\"country\": \"US\", \"postal_code\": \"94105\"},\n        \"shipping_method\": \"\",\n        \"routing_tag\": \"beta\",\n        \"card_number\": \"4111\",\n    }\n    migrated = convert_order(payload)\n    assert migrated[\"orderId\"] == \"E500\"\n    assert migrated[\"buyer\"] == {\"id\": \"C-11\", \"displayName\": \"Iris\"}\n    assert migrated[\"lineItems\"] == [{\"sku\": \"MUG\", \"quantity\": 4, \"unitPriceCents\": 325}]\n    assert migrated[\"shipping\"][\"method\"] == \"standard\"\n    assert migrated[\"shipping\"][\"address\"][\"postalCode\"] == \"94105\"\n    assert migrated[\"metadata\"][\"unknownFields\"] == {\"routing_tag\": \"beta\"}","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":68,"totalLines":68,"truncated":false}},"title":"workspace/in/schema_migration/tests/test_client.py","time":{"start":1788187506052,"end":1788187506070}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_08e527235fe39e7c016a959371ecfc87d28f011eef8b3e9c4d"}},"id":"prt_05847f580001oqBW5oPA4D4ZGX","sessionID":"ses_fa7b8803dffeRqKSqOdXqoOMCz","messageID":"msg_05847e675001KYJEdXm0iIP7fq"}}
