{"type":"text","timestamp":1788187511904,"sessionID":"ses_fa7b8803dffeRqKSqOdXqoOMCz","part":{"id":"prt_0584806140013VdS2gomcpwrLP","messageID":"msg_05847f5c10019e7k0tyupxMBEx","sessionID":"ses_fa7b8803dffeRqKSqOdXqoOMCz","type":"text","text":"I have the mapping rules and current tests. Next I’m checking the schemas so `client.py` emits the exact v2 field names and structure expected by hidden cases too.","time":{"start":1788187510292,"end":1788187511891},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0a597570371734e0016a959376323c87d2bc43a89dde73e62c","phase":"commentary"}}}}
