{"type":"text","timestamp":1788187659274,"sessionID":"ses_fa7b8803dffeRqKSqOdXqoOMCz","part":{"id":"prt_0584a49ad001ED7T1caVwzLA0A","messageID":"msg_0584a3d1f001s94GuC2sXH67EB","sessionID":"ses_fa7b8803dffeRqKSqOdXqoOMCz","type":"text","text":"`pytest` isn’t installed in this environment, so I’m doing a direct `python3` verification against the shipped test cases and the CLI behavior instead.","time":{"start":1788187658669,"end":1788187659265},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_026db6c7c8a0024b016a95940a8f9887d29230a066bd18eaaa","phase":"commentary"}}}}
